\Delta c_4 = 248.2 \text{ (for } \text{SO}_2(g))
\]

Substitute the known values into the equation:

\[
\Delta c_i = 2 \times 91.2 + 3 \times 205.1 - 2 \times 66.5 - 2 \times 248.2
\]

