\]

Given the distance between the Ca2+ and Cl- ions in the circuit lattice is 0.231 nm, we can calculate the lattice energy as follows:

\[
\text{Latting Energy} = \frac{2.21 \times 10^{-19} J \cdot \text{nm}^2}{(0.231 \text{ nm})^2}
\]

Substitute the given distance into the formula:

